  "48": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "For the target video, use <Picture 1> as a reference frame — Character 1 is <Picture 1>; keep their face, hair, build and clothing exactly as shown in the reference frame, identical and unchanged from the first frame to the last.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action cinematic, medium-full shot of a woman walking forward in an endless white studio void, the camera tracking backward at normal speed while she strides aggressively with bruised legs and a stained white t-shirt, her arms swinging heavily with momentum and her head snapping slightly to the left. [Shot 2] At 00:01.200, The camera cuts to a low Dutch-angle close-up of her bare feet hitting the glossy white floor, the background rushing by in a blur of motion, her shadow stretching beneath her as the camera tilts up rapidly to follow her leg muscles bunching and relaxing. [Shot 3] At 00:02.400, A medium shot from the side captures <Picture 1> pivoting on her heel, her body twisting violently to face the camera, a red mark on her cheek becoming more prominent as she closes the distance, the camera shaking slightly with the impact of her turn. [Shot 4] At 00:03.600, The camera pushes in with large amplitude at fast speed to an extreme close-up of her face, her eyes darting wildly, sweat glistening on her skin as she throws her shoulder forward into the lens, her hair whipping across her field of view. [Shot 5] At 00:04.800, A high-angle overhead shot looking straight down at the subject, her form appearing small in the vast white space, she spins in a tight circle, arms flailing, creating a dynamic vortex of movement while the camera rotates counter-clockwise to match her momentum. [Shot 6] At 00:06.000, The camera cuts to a tracking shot from behind, following her sprint away from the lens toward a vanishing point, her t-shirt flapping wildly in the air, the lighting strobing sharply on every other step. [Shot 7] At 00:07.200, A low-angle shot from the ground level captures her leaping upward, suspended in mid-air, her expression intense and focused, her limbs extending fully before gravity begins to pull her back down, the camera tilting up to keep her centered. [Shot 8] At 00:08.400, A slow-motion close-up of her landing, the impact causing a ripple in the white floor, dust motes exploding outward from her feet, her body absorbing the shock with bent knees and a grimace of exertion. [Shot 9] At 00:09.400, The camera pulls out rapidly to a wide shot, <Picture 1> standing tall and still in the center of the frame, her chest heaving, her arms dropping to her sides, the motion freezing slightly before she takes one final breath.\n\noverall_soundscape: Heavy, rhythmic thuds of bare feet slapping against a hard surface, the sharp intake of breath from exertion, the soft rustle of cotton fabric whipping in the air, and a sharp crack of energy or wood when she pivots in Shot 3.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A driving industrial electronic track with a heavy bass kick, starting with a slow build, hitting a sharp snare roll at the pivot in Shot 3, and ending with a sudden silence on the final frame."
    },
